WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.713
1ST ASSISTANT DIRECTOR
3..2..1... Action!

00:00:11.532 --> 00:00:13.347
SCARLETT JOHANSSON
Black Widow is something that

00:00:13.347 --> 00:00:16.742
the Marvel Universe has
never experienced before.

00:00:17.837 --> 00:00:20.424
The action in this film is real.

00:00:21.258 --> 00:00:26.360
You have these huge armored vehicles going
through these iconic streets in Budapest.

00:00:28.303 --> 00:00:33.763
Budapest itself is so important to who
Natasha really is and what drives her,

00:00:33.763 --> 00:00:37.136
and she finds this
family from her past there.

00:00:37.525 --> 00:00:40.181
NATASHA ROMANOFF
So we're gonna talk like grown-ups?

00:00:40.181 --> 00:00:41.549
YELENA BELOVA
Is that what we are?

00:00:43.523 --> 00:00:45.761
FLORENCE PUGH
Within like two days of knowing Scarlett,

00:00:45.761 --> 00:00:48.411
I was just ramming
her into a door frame.

00:00:49.102 --> 00:00:53.404
All the fighting in this film is so
emotional and about not knowing

00:00:53.404 --> 00:00:55.070
how to say what you feel.

00:00:59.028 --> 00:01:01.028
NATASHA ROMANOFF
It's good to see you too, sis.

00:01:01.728 --> 00:01:03.744
SCARLETT JOHANSSON
There's some of the most intense fights

00:01:03.744 --> 00:01:05.751
that we've had in the MCU.

00:01:05.776 --> 00:01:07.784
DAVID HARBOUR
There's this big fight scene in this

00:01:07.784 --> 00:01:12.030
enormous prison.
There were 400 extras.

00:01:13.506 --> 00:01:14.855
RACHEL WEISZ
It sort of doesn't feel like a movie.

00:01:14.855 --> 00:01:15.855
It feels real.

00:01:18.942 --> 00:01:21.141
CATE SHORTLAND
I wanted to create something really

00:01:21.141 --> 00:01:26.140
visceral and fun, but to
talk about Natasha as a human being.

00:01:26.842 --> 00:01:30.507
To let audiences see a side of her
that they had never seen before.

00:01:31.869 --> 00:01:33.004
SCARLETT JOHANSSON
I've spent a decade of time with

00:01:33.004 --> 00:01:34.257
this character,

00:01:35.551 --> 00:01:39.107
and she's finally able
to write her own story.

00:01:44.944 --> 00:01:46.944
NATASHA ROMANOFF
I'm done running from my past.

